OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies call for kindness for
OL,4,Aautistic children
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is a call for islanders to be
OL,7,Fmore considerate of families with
OL,8,Fneurodivergent or disabled children.
OL,10,FThree Guernsey mothers - Rachel, Vic
OL,11,Fand Jess - said they decided to speak
OL,12,Fout following a number of incidents
OL,13,Fwhere they have felt judged or heard
OL,14,Fupsetting comments about their autistic
OL,15,Fchildren's behaviour.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
