OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies call for kindness for
OL,4,Aautistic children
OL,5,
OL,6,FJess, whose son Ellis is autistic, has
OL,7,Fa verbal delay and learning
OL,8,Fdifficulties, said: "They [members of
OL,9,Fthe public] feel irritated enough to
OL,10,Fsay a small comment, but that small
OL,11,Fcomment sticks with you as a parent for
OL,12,Fa long time."
OL,14,FThe mothers said it could make them
OL,15,Fdoubt themselves when parenting was
OL,16,F"hard enough already".
